Update Manager — platform launchers
===================================

The app itself is one cross-platform file. Everywhere you can simply run:

    python updatemanager.py        (or python3 updatemanager.py)

These launchers are optional double-click conveniences. Each one is clearly
labelled in its header with the operating system it is dedicated to. They all
end up invoking the same updatemanager.py, and they auto-activate the shared
virtualenv at <Crypto>/env if it exists.

  linux/
    updatemanager.sh        Bash launcher (Linux).
    UpdateManager.desktop   Application-menu entry (Linux). Replace {INSTALL_DIR}
                            and copy to ~/.local/share/applications.

  macos/
    UpdateManager.command   Double-clickable launcher (macOS). Run once:
                            chmod +x UpdateManager.command

  windows/
    UpdateManager.bat       Command-Prompt launcher (Windows), no console window.
    UpdateManager.vbs       Fully silent launcher (Windows) — recommended for a
                            desktop/Start-menu shortcut.
